<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Lotus Docs Example Site</title><link>/</link><description>Recent content on Lotus Docs Example Site</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-GB</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 08 Sep 2023 05:12:51 +0100</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Démarrage rapide</title><link>/fr/docs/quickstart/</link><pubDate>Wed, 03 May 2023 22:37:22 +0100</pubDate><guid>/fr/docs/quickstart/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="créer-un-nouveau-contenu"&gt;Créer un nouveau contenu&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Navigate to the root of your Hugo project and use the &lt;code&gt;hugo new&lt;/code&gt; command to create a file in the &lt;code&gt;content/docs&lt;/code&gt; directory:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-shell" data-lang="shell"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;hugo new docs/example-page.md&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;This will create a markdown file named &lt;code&gt;example-page.md&lt;/code&gt; with the following default front matter:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-toml" data-lang="toml"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#960050;background-color:#1e0010"&gt;+++&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;title&lt;/span&gt; = &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;Example Page&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;description&lt;/span&gt; = &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;icon&lt;/span&gt; = &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;article&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;date&lt;/span&gt; = &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;2023-05-22T00:27:57+01:00&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;lastmod&lt;/span&gt; = &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;2023-05-22T00:27:57+01:00&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;draft&lt;/span&gt; = &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;false&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;toc&lt;/span&gt; = &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;weight&lt;/span&gt; = &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;999&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#960050;background-color:#1e0010"&gt;+++&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Modify the options to suit your needs.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;The code below shows the front matter code used to create this page, along with some markdown in the body:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Schnellstart</title><link>/de/docs/quickstart/</link><pubDate>Wed, 03 May 2023 22:37:22 +0100</pubDate><guid>/de/docs/quickstart/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="neue-inhalte-erstellen"&gt;Neue Inhalte erstellen&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Navigate to the root of your Hugo project and use the &lt;code&gt;hugo new&lt;/code&gt; command to create a file in the &lt;code&gt;content/docs&lt;/code&gt; directory:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-shell" data-lang="shell"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;hugo new docs/example-page.md&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;This will create a markdown file named &lt;code&gt;example-page.md&lt;/code&gt; with the following default front matter:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-toml" data-lang="toml"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#960050;background-color:#1e0010"&gt;+++&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;title&lt;/span&gt; = &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;Example Page&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;description&lt;/span&gt; = &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;icon&lt;/span&gt; = &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;article&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;date&lt;/span&gt; = &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;2023-05-22T00:27:57+01:00&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;lastmod&lt;/span&gt; = &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;2023-05-22T00:27:57+01:00&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;draft&lt;/span&gt; = &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;false&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;toc&lt;/span&gt; = &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;weight&lt;/span&gt; = &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;999&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#960050;background-color:#1e0010"&gt;+++&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Modify the options to suit your needs.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;The code below shows the front matter code used to create this page, along with some markdown in the body:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Code</title><link>/docs/example-content/code/</link><pubDate>Mon, 22 May 2023 00:44:31 +0100</pubDate><guid>/docs/example-content/code/</guid><description>&lt;div class="alert alert-warning d-flex" role="alert"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="flex-shrink-1 alert-icon"&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="material-icons size-20 me-2"&gt;&#10; warning&#10; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="w-100"&gt;The front matter &lt;code&gt;description&lt;/code&gt; value for this page has been intentionally left empty in order to demonstrate FlexSearch&amp;rsquo;s suggested results fallback behaviour.&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="code-block-examples"&gt;Code Block Examples &lt;a href="#code-block-examples" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;i class="material-icons align-middle"&gt;link&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Code block language examples&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="go"&gt;Go &lt;a href="#go" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;i class="material-icons align-middle"&gt;link&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; &lt;div class="prism-codeblock "&gt;&#10; &lt;pre id="9a3c1c7" class="language-go "&gt;&#10; &lt;code&gt;package main&#10;&#10;import &amp;#34;fmt&amp;#34;&#10;&#10;func main() {&#10; fmt.Println(&amp;#34;hello world&amp;#34;)&#10;}&lt;/code&gt;&#10; &lt;/pre&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="html"&gt;HTML &lt;a href="#html" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;i class="material-icons align-middle"&gt;link&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; &lt;div class="prism-codeblock "&gt;&#10; &lt;pre id="97da112" class="language-html "&gt;&#10; &lt;code&gt;&amp;lt;!DOCTYPE html&amp;gt;&#10;&amp;lt;html&amp;gt;&#10;&amp;lt;body&amp;gt;&#10;&#10;&amp;lt;h1&amp;gt;My First Heading&amp;lt;/h1&amp;gt;&#10;&#10;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;My first paragraph.&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&#10;&#10;&amp;lt;/body&amp;gt;&#10;&amp;lt;/html&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt;&#10; &lt;/pre&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="markdown"&gt;Markdown &lt;a href="#markdown" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;i class="material-icons align-middle"&gt;link&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; &lt;div class="prism-codeblock "&gt;&#10; &lt;pre id="d313788" class="language-md "&gt;&#10; &lt;code&gt;# H1 heading&lt;/code&gt;&#10; &lt;/pre&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;</description></item><item><title>Mermaid</title><link>/docs/example-content/mermaid/</link><pubDate>Fri, 08 Sep 2023 05:12:51 +0100</pubDate><guid>/docs/example-content/mermaid/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="flowchart"&gt;Flowchart &lt;a href="#flowchart" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;i class="material-icons align-middle"&gt;link&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;pre class="mermaid"&gt;flowchart LR&#10;&#10;A[Hard] --&amp;gt;|Text| B(Round)&#10;B --&amp;gt; C{Decision}&#10;C --&amp;gt;|One| D[Result 1]&#10;C --&amp;gt;|Two| E[Result 2]&#10;&lt;/pre&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="sequence-diagram"&gt;Sequence diagram &lt;a href="#sequence-diagram" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;i class="material-icons align-middle"&gt;link&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;pre class="mermaid"&gt;sequenceDiagram&#10;autonumber&#10;Alice-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;John: Hello John, how are you?&#10;loop Healthcheck&#10; John-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;John: Fight against hypochondria&#10;end&#10;Note right of John: Rational thoughts!&#10;John--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Alice: Great!&#10;John-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Bob: How about you?&#10;Bob--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;John: Jolly good!&#10;&lt;/pre&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="gantt-chart"&gt;Gantt Chart &lt;a href="#gantt-chart" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;i class="material-icons align-middle"&gt;link&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;pre class="mermaid"&gt;gantt&#10; section Section&#10; Completed :done, des1, 2014-01-06,2014-01-08&#10; Active :active, des2, 2014-01-07, 3d&#10; Parallel 1 : des3, after des1, 1d&#10; Parallel 2 : des4, after des1, 1d&#10; Parallel 3 : des5, after des3, 1d&#10; Parallel 4 : des6, after des4, 1d&#10;&lt;/pre&gt;</description></item><item><title>Example Doc</title><link>/docs/section-folder/section-subfolder/second-section-subfolder/third-section-subfolder/example-doc/</link><pubDate>Wed, 03 May 2023 22:37:22 +0100</pubDate><guid>/docs/section-folder/section-subfolder/second-section-subfolder/third-section-subfolder/example-doc/</guid><description/></item></channel></rss>